title: $:/dndwiki/language/en-GB/Calendar/Harptos/Description
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

A widespread system of measuring time. Years are counted by Dalereckoning (DR), and a year is divided by the Calendar of Harptos.

A year has 12 months of 3 tendays (30 days) each. In addition there are 5 festival days between the months, and every 4 years Shieldmeet. Festival days are day 31 of the preceding month (Midwinter = `1351-01-31`), Shieldmeet is day 32 after Flamerule.
